        "note": "86% of the claim's wording appears in the reference article, including 5 number(s)",
        "correction": null,
        "method": "wikipedia-lexical"
      },
      {
        "claim": "The line was abandoned on 1 April 1879 after Britain took control of salt production, and standard histories of the period largely omitted it.",
        "segment_index": 3,
